{"id":"47eb87fb-fedc-401d-9b65-a0602171b517","object":"chat.completion","created":1784962565,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    threshold = case['threshold']\\n    calls = case['calls']\\n    accepted_call_ids = []\\n    diagnostics = []\\n    for call in calls:\\n        call_id = call['call_id']\\n        loss_without = call['loss_without_call']\\n        loss_with = call['loss_with_call']\\n        tokens = call['prediction_tokens']\\n        parseable = call['parseable']\\n        if not isinstance(parseable, bool):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"parseable must be a boolean\\\")\\n        if tokens <= 0:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"prediction_tokens must be positive\\\")\\n        gain = loss_without - loss_with\\n        normalized_gain = gain / tokens\\n        accepted = parseable and normalized_gain >= threshold\\n        if accepted:\\n            accepted_call_ids.append(call_id)\\n        diagnostics.append({\\n            \\\"accepted\\\": accepted,\\n            \\\"call_id\\\": call_id,\\n            \\\"normalized_gain\\\": normalized_gain\\n        })\\n    return {\\n        \\\"accepted_call_ids\\\": accepted_call_ids,\\n        \\\"diagnostics\\\": diagnostics\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for task AGENT-TF-01. The task is to filter API calls based on normalized gain threshold.\n\nThe payload contains:\n- threshold (number)\n- calls: list of objects with call_id, loss_without_call, loss_with_call, prediction_tokens, parseable.\n\nRequirements:\n- For each call, compute gain = loss_without_call - loss_with_call.\n- Normalize gain by prediction_tokens: normalized_gain = gain / prediction_tokens.\n- Accept call if parseable is True and normalized_gain >= threshold.\n- Return output with:\n  - accepted_call_ids: list of call_ids of accepted calls in order they appear in input calls.\n  - diagnostics